SUMMARY
  Native SwiftUI implementation of the web AlertsListPage at full panel/chart/
  state/string parity, adaptive across macOS + iOS (ADR-002/006). Driven by an
  @Observable AlertsListPageModel that consumes the KMP-core seam (ADR-004) via
  web-named hooks. Ten panels, two native Swift Charts surfaces, the four data
  states and all 36 catalog strings. 14 files, 2,649 LOC (web unit ≈ 1,020 LOC
  across page + AlertCard + AlertDetailTimeline + AcknowledgeAlertDialog).

FILES (all within allowed scope: apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Notifications/**)
  AlertsListPageModels.swift          domain types (severity, item, event, detail,
                                      rule, pin, trend/slice, stats, tab, state, toast)
  AlertsListPageFormat.swift          fmtInt / percent / timeAgo / typeLabel / weekday
  AlertsListPageMath.swift            stats, byType, byDay, weekCount, tab/search filter,
                                      pager, pinnedRules (web useMemo derivations)
