                                      useMarkAlertRead, useAcknowledgeAlertHook,
                                      useReopenAlertHook, useAlertDetailHook, usePinned)
                                      + deterministic in-memory store (KMP seam)
  AlertsListPageModel.swift           @Observable state + derived props
  AlertsListPageModel+Actions.swift   load/refresh, tab/search/pager, mark-read,
                                      acknowledge dialog, reopen, detail, toast
  AlertsListPageComponents.swift      AlertsCard (GlassPanel), section header,
