  AlertsListPageRouteRegistration.swift  typed NavigationDestination (web /notifications/alerts)
  + apps/apple/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings  (+57 string entries; web key names)
  + apps/parity/apple-ledger.json                  (+2 rows: apple-macos, apple-ios)

