NOTES
  • Units: alert data is dimensionless (counts) — no SI conversion applies; the SI
    converters are honored where pages carry physical quantities (N/A here).
  • Adaptivity: ViewThatFits drives the secondary line, the by-type chart row and the
    two-column chart grid; frame(maxWidth: 1100) centers wide (macOS/iPad) layouts;
    list/sheets use HIG materials + ContentUnavailableView + .redacted.
  • a11y: accessibilityLabel/value/traits on panels, metric tiles, both charts, rows,
    timeline; Dynamic Type via Font.TS; light/dark + increased-contrast via Color.TS.
  • Live/staleness: model.isStale (>120s) → AlertsStalenessChip (common.staleData), ADR-013.

